# Barricades: walk to the yard window, let a zombie pull a board, hold interact to repair it, and see the boards and points go up.
expect barricades.boards 5
expect hud.points 0
until zombies.alive 4 300
key F1
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
key Enter
key Tab
key Enter
key F1
expect zombies.alive 0
expect hud.break true
face 130 0
hold move_forward
wait 235
release move_forward
face 90 0
wait 20
expect hud.prompt_visible false
state 01-full
shot 01-full
key F1
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
key Enter
key F1
until barricades.boards 4 900
until hud.prompt HOLD E REPAIR 4/5 30
state 02-damaged
shot 02-damaged
hold interact
until barricades.boards 5 180
release interact
expect hud.points 10
state 03-repaired
shot 03-repaired
